{'symbol': 'PANW', 'date': '2022-11-09 08:15:00', 'title': 'PALO ALTO NETWORKS NAMED A LEADER IN INAUGURAL FROST & SULLIVAN CLOUD-NATIVE APPLICATION PROTECTION PLATFORMS REPORT', 'text': 'PRISMA CLOUD RECOGNIZED FOR REMARKABLE GROWTH, CONTINUOUS INNOVATION AND COMPLETE CODE-TO-CLOUD SECURITY SANTA CLARA, CALIF. , NOV. 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PALO ALTO NETWORKS (NASDAQ: PANW), THE GLOBAL CYBERSECURITY LEADER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS FLAGSHIP CLOUD SECURITY PLATFORM, PRISMA® CLOUD, HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS A LEADER IN THE INAUGURAL FROST RADAR™: CLOUD-NATIVE APPLICATION PROTECTION PLATFORMS (CNAPP), 2022.'}